TIMING-4#1 Critical Warning
Invalid primary clock redefinition on a clock tree  
Invalid clock redefinition on a clock tree. The primary clock dmm_design_i/clk_wiz_0/inst/clk_in1 is defined downstream of clock clk_fpga_2 and overrides its insertion delay and/or waveform definition
